#   ki "{b}*Shouts*{/b} Watch out!! The big one! They’re going to hit us!"
    ki "{b}*Gritos*{/b} Cuidado!! O grandão! Eles vão nos atingir!"

# game/chapters/chapter4/script/ch4sc16.rpy:821
